                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Its an ok map with a quarantine line in the middle that blocks mostly foods. Beginning can be confusing with steel and how to get it, but you will get there. Not much worrying about money. You have 8t, 20t, 40t trucks and the 20t truck can drive almost everywhere. Theres quite a lot of hard cities you gotta plan out and make your own factory. I did it in 60 hours, you can subtract some because of AFK time. Overall experience id say an 8/10.",
